// Copy this file to ios/Flutter/Secrets.xcconfig (gitignored) to skip pasting
// your key into Settings during development. DEBUG BUILDS ONLY: Release and
// Profile builds never read it. Never commit the real Secrets.xcconfig.
//
// The normal way to add a key is the app's Settings screen, which stores it
// in the iPhone's Keychain.
//
// Note: xcconfig treats "//" as a comment, so a key containing "//" would need
// escaping as "/$()/". Presage keys don't normally contain slashes.
PRESAGE_API_KEY = paste-your-presage-api-key-here
